<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Friday LG&amp;E Energy Corp was unavailable for news pending.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA also was unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
